{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Sanguis of the Mater, the Stillae are born, elite warriors who bare the last of their divinities hope, for you to lead them in a battle to save a dying world. Fight in tactical combat against the forces of Stasis and restore the flow of life! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/de1fb7a63413efe9ccb6fde7dd83313b.poster.avif?t=1764845256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/de1fb7a63413efe9ccb6fde7dd83313b.webm?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/de1fb7a63413efe9ccb6fde7dd83313b.mp4?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your perfect plan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your next moves with dynamic turn-based combat, strategically triggering epic chains of events across the battlefield:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Timeline Effects</strong> to speed up, delay or swap time position to impact turn order and outsmart your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with your surroundings</strong> that can explode, ignite enemies, or block sight... changing the outcome of the battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leverage spatial effects</strong> like knock backs, forced facings, flanking bonuses, and damage-over-time to dominate every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock a vast arsenal of abilities,</strong> each offering powerful synergies and deep build customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/da4ea578a2e712485a0903677790946a.poster.avif?t=1764845256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/da4ea578a2e712485a0903677790946a.webm?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/da4ea578a2e712485a0903677790946a.mp4?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take on risks and progress</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own path, your own difficulty through the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on high-risk, high-reward missions, head straight for boss encounters, or slow down to gather resources to increase your chance of success. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All missions contribute to gradual progress and reflect the type of experience you decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/79e235aeffc55478114f50e57f871445.poster.avif?t=1764845256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/79e235aeffc55478114f50e57f871445.webm?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/79e235aeffc55478114f50e57f871445.mp4?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Roguelite loop adapted to turn-based combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to random skill drops by combining them with your unique load outs, generating different synergies between your STILLAE.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim procedural levels to grow your Sanguine presence, beat unique bosses and understand the world in Stasia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is not the end, even in death progress is made and the Mater will summon her children anew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Crimson Rebellion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world drained by the Purge, blood is defiance. Each drop of it paints the world in reds and blacks, as a reminder that life fights back. This is not just violence, it's a vivid rebellion in a pale, colorless world against those who would see it in Stasis forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/2ded69df640704357479484a383a4be1.poster.avif?t=1764845256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/2ded69df640704357479484a383a4be1.webm?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/2ded69df640704357479484a383a4be1.mp4?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3275050?t=1764845256","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3275050?t=1764845256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/1317470634a3926150186af20124d1172e6c1f36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764845256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/1317470634a3926150186af20124d1172e6c1f36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764845256","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages.\r\nThis game contains frequent violence, blood and gore, and general mature content. Combat may result in characters being wounded or killed, often accompanied by stylized blood effects."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Sanguis of the Mater, the Stillae are born, elite warriors who bare the last of their divinities hope, for you to lead them in a battle to save a dying world. Fight in tactical combat against the forces of Stasis and restore the flow of life! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/de1fb7a63413efe9ccb6fde7dd83313b.poster.avif?t=1764845256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/de1fb7a63413efe9ccb6fde7dd83313b.webm?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/de1fb7a63413efe9ccb6fde7dd83313b.mp4?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your perfect plan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your next moves with dynamic turn-based combat, strategically triggering epic chains of events across the battlefield:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Timeline Effects</strong> to speed up, delay or swap time position to impact turn order and outsmart your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with your surroundings</strong> that can explode, ignite enemies, or block sight... changing the outcome of the battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leverage spatial effects</strong> like knock backs, forced facings, flanking bonuses, and damage-over-time to dominate every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock a vast arsenal of abilities,</strong> each offering powerful synergies and deep build customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/da4ea578a2e712485a0903677790946a.poster.avif?t=1764845256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/da4ea578a2e712485a0903677790946a.webm?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/da4ea578a2e712485a0903677790946a.mp4?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take on risks and progress</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own path, your own difficulty through the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on high-risk, high-reward missions, head straight for boss encounters, or slow down to gather resources to increase your chance of success. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All missions contribute to gradual progress and reflect the type of experience you decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/79e235aeffc55478114f50e57f871445.poster.avif?t=1764845256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/79e235aeffc55478114f50e57f871445.webm?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/79e235aeffc55478114f50e57f871445.mp4?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Roguelite loop adapted to turn-based combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to random skill drops by combining them with your unique load outs, generating different synergies between your STILLAE.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim procedural levels to grow your Sanguine presence, beat unique bosses and understand the world in Stasia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is not the end, even in death progress is made and the Mater will summon her children anew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Crimson Rebellion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world drained by the Purge, blood is defiance. Each drop of it paints the world in reds and blacks, as a reminder that life fights back. This is not just violence, it's a vivid rebellion in a pale, colorless world against those who would see it in Stasis forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/2ded69df640704357479484a383a4be1.poster.avif?t=1764845256\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/2ded69df640704357479484a383a4be1.webm?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/extras/2ded69df640704357479484a383a4be1.mp4?t=1764845256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Lightbulb Crew"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275050/7df9